  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Something**: back after 24 archived shows (703 days) [3]\n- **Reverb**: back after 29 archived shows (734 days) [3]\n- **Bewildered**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Fa-Fa-Fa-Fa-Fa (Sad Song)**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Quitters Never Win**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **West LA Fadeaway**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Space Captain**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Get Out My Life Woman**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2015-03-17.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 16 songs; 134 min [1]\n- **soulive2015-03-17.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 16 songs; 134 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show was Night 4 of the Bowlive VI run at Brooklyn Bowl [1]\n- The show was Night 4 of the Bowlive VI run at Brooklyn Bowl [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2015-03-17.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Audience/SBD Matrix [1]. Also: Two sources were mixed: Schoeps cmc622xt on-stage mics through Sonosax, Apogee and Sound Devices 744T, plus the soundboard feed, recorded at 24/96; Transfer: WAVs time-aligned in SoundForge Pro 11, then mixed and rendered in Vegas Pro 13; this is the 24-bit version [1]\n- **soulive2015-03-17.cmc622xt.sbd.matrix.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: On Stage Audience/SBD Matrix [2]. Also: Matrix of Schoeps cmc622xt on-stage mics and soundboard feed (Digidesign/Avid Profile), both captured via Sound Devices 744T at 24/96; Downconverted to 16-bit/44.1 kHz using iZotope SRC and MBIT+ dither, after normalizing and fades in SoundForge, then FLAC [2]",
